      "id": 1,
      "text": "Basque fishermen in the 16th century likely named Placentia after Plasencia, Spain, giving the town its enduring name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
